    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that, i really do. but it doesn't change the math of it. they had so much more to give, so much more life left in them. i'm just... existing. it feels like i'm just occupying a seat that was supposed to be theirs. it's like i'm living on borrowed time that i never even asked for.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
